      "description": "深色编辑性内容区的定制入口。",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-shop-button ds-shop-light\">去试试我的想法</button>",
      "css": ".ds-shop-button{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:50px;gap:10px;padding:13px 24px;border:1px solid var(--ink,#16130c);border-radius:var(--button-radius,99px);background:var(--ink,#16130c);color:var(--page,#faf8f3);font:600 14px/1.3 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color .18s ease-out}.ds-shop-button:hover{background:var(--shop-dark-2,#211b10);border-color:var(--shop-dark-2,#211b10);color:var(--on-dark,#f4eedf)}.ds-shop-button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#8c6d1f);outline-offset:5px}.ds-shop-button:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:not-allowed}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-shop-button{min-height:48px;padding-inline:20px;font-size:13px}}.ds-shop-button.ds-shop-light{color:var(--shop-dark,#14100a);background:var(--on-dark,#f4eedf);border-color:var(--on-dark,#f4eedf)}.ds-shop-button.ds-shop-light:hover{background:var(--shop-dark-2,#211b10);border-color:var(--shop-dark-2,#211b10);color:var(--on-dark,#f4eedf)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "相言 · 顶部风格选择",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "shop-theme-select",
      "description": "四主题共用的原生 select，移动端仍可见；此片段只展示控件外观。",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-style\"><span class=\"ds-visually-hidden\">网站风格</span><select><option>巴黎极简</option><option>法式浪漫</option><option>意式雕塑</option><option>建筑黑白</option></select></label>",
      "css": ".ds-style select{font:12px -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink,#16130c);min-height:40px;max-width:135px;border:1px solid var(--line,#e4dcc8);padding:8px 11px;border-radius:var(--button-radius,99px);background:var(--panel,#fff)}.ds-style select:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#8c6d1f);outline-offset:3px}.ds-visually-hidden{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;padding:0;margin:-1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0,0,0,0);white-space:nowrap;border:0}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-style select{max-width:116px;padding:7px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "相言 · 编辑器款式选择",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "shop-style-picker",
      "description": "五款编辑器共用的款式入口；此片段只展示控件外观。",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-style-picker\">戒指款式<select><option>围钻戒指</option><option>花环戒指</option><option>花冠戒指</option><option>繁花戒指</option><option>冠冕戒指</option></select></label>",
      "css": ".ds-style-picker{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin:0 0 22px;color:var(--muted,#5a5344);font:12px -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif}.ds-style-picker select{min-height:40px;border:1px solid var(--line,#e4dcc8);background:var(--panel,#fff);color:var(--ink,#16130c);border-radius:var(--button-radius,99px);padding:7px 30px 7px 13px;font:13px -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif}.ds-style-picker select:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#8c6d1f);outline-offset:3px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "相言 · 主导航",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "shop-navigation",
      "description": "桌面导航链接片段，手机端由菜单展开承载同一导航。",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-shop-nav\" aria-label=\"主导航\"><a href=\"#/diy/collection\">款式系列</a><a href=\"#/stonefirst/ring-02\">专属定制</a><a href=\"#/diy/story\">关于相言</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-shop-nav{display:flex;gap:26px;align-items:center;background:var(--page,#faf8f3);color:var(--ink,#16130c)}.ds-shop-nav a{display:flex;align-items:center;min-height:44px;border-bottom:1px solid transparent;color:inherit;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;font:13px -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif}.ds-shop-nav a:hover{border-bottom-color:var(--accent,#8c6d1f);color:var(--accent,#8c6d1f)}.ds-shop-nav a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#8c6d1f);outline-offset:5px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "相言 · 购物车汇总",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "shop-cart-summary",
      "description": "方案数量与演示参考合计；不表示可结算支付。",
      "html": "<aside class=\"ds-cart-summary\"><h2>心意清单</h2><p>当前为演示购物车，暂不收款。</p><a class=\"ds-shop-button\" href=\"#/diy/collection\">继续挑选</a></aside>",
      "css": ".ds-shop-button{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:50px;gap:10px;padding:13px 24px;border:1px solid var(--ink,#16130c);border-radius:var(--button-radius,99px);background:var(--ink,#16130c);color:var(--page,#faf8f3);font:600 14px/1.3 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color .18s ease-out}.ds-shop-button:hover{background:var(--shop-dark-2,#211b10);border-color:var(--shop-dark-2,#211b10);color:var(--on-dark,#f4eedf)}.ds-shop-button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#8c6d1f);outline-offset:5px}.ds-shop-button:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:not-allowed}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-shop-button{min-height:48px;padding-inline:20px;font-size:13px}}.ds-cart-summary{padding:26px;border:1px solid var(--line,#e4dcc8);border-radius:var(--shop-radius,14px);background:var(--panel,#fff);color:var(--ink,#16130c);max-width:320px}.ds-cart-summary h2{margin:0;font:var(--display-weight,500) 24px/1.65 var(--shop-title,\"Songti SC\",serif)}.ds-cart-summary p{font:12px/1.8 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;color:var(--muted,#5a5344);margin:18px 0 22px}.ds-cart-summary .ds-shop-button{display:flex}"
    },
    {
      "name": "相言 · 选中选项",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "shop-option-selected",
      "description": "编辑器浅底选中项采用较深强调文字与边线。",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-shop-option\" aria-pressed=\"true\">原款</button>",
      "css": ".ds-shop-option{min-height:39px;padding:7px 11px;border:1px solid var(--accent,#8c6d1f);border-radius:var(--button-radius,99px);background:var(--tint,#f1ebdd);color:var(--accent-hover,#715618);font:13px -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;cursor:pointer}.ds-shop-option:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#8c6d1f);outline-offset:5px}.ds-shop-option:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:not-allowed}.ds-shop-option:hover:enabled{background:var(--tint,#f1ebdd);border-color:var(--accent,#8c6d1f)}@media(max-width:800px){.ds-shop-option{min-height:43px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:no-preference){.ds-shop-option{transition:background-color .18s ease-out,border-color .18s ease-out,color .18s ease-out}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "FORME · 重置编辑",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "forme-button",
      "description": "现有浅底操作按钮；重置可撤销，不承担本机保存。",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-forme-button\">重置编辑</button>",
      "css": ".ds-forme-button{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:36px;padding:0 12px;border:1px solid #dfd9cf;border-radius:2px;background:#fffefb;color:#302c29;font:12px Manrope,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color .16s,color .16s,border-color .16s}.ds-forme-button:hover:not(:disabled){background:#ede6df}.ds-forme-button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #71394a;outline-offset:3px}.ds-forme-button:disabled{opacity:.42;cursor:default}@media(max-width:700px){.ds-forme-button{min-height:44px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-forme-button{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "FORME · 作品名称",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "forme-input",
      "description": "素材页的名称输入框，保留可见标签和 80 字符上限。",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-forme-label\" for=\"ds-forme-name\">作品名称</label><input class=\"ds-forme-input\" id=\"ds-forme-name\" maxlength=\"80\" value=\"四照花 · 独立拼接戒指\"/>",
      "css": ".ds-forme-label{display:block;margin:24px 0 12px;color:#302c29;font:13px Manrope,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif}.ds-forme-input{width:100%;min-width:0;padding:7px 9px;border:1px solid #dfd9cf;border-radius:2px;background:#fffefb;color:#302c29;caret-color:#71394a;font:13px Manrope,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif}.ds-forme-input:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #71394a;outline-offset:3px}@media(max-width:700px){.ds-forme-label{margin:16px 0 8px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "FORME · 参数页签",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "forme-tab-selected",
      "description": "现有五类编辑页签；暗红文字和下边线共同表示选中。",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-forme-tabs\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"编辑工具\"><button role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\">材质</button><button role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">花形</button><button role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">尺寸</button><button role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">款式</button><button role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">素材</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-forme-tabs{display:flex;gap:4px;margin-top:24px;border-bottom:1px solid #dfd9cf}.ds-forme-tabs button{flex:1;min-width:0;min-height:44px;padding:0 8px;border:0;border-bottom:2px solid transparent;background:none;color:#6b6259;font:13px Manrope,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;white-space:nowrap;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color .16s,color .16s,border-color .16s}.ds-forme-tabs [aria-selected=true]{border-bottom-color:#71394a;color:#71394a;font-weight:600}.ds-forme-tabs button:hover{background:#ede6df}.ds-forme-tabs button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #71394a;outline-offset:3px}@media(max-width:700px){.ds-forme-tabs{margin:0;gap:0}.ds-forme-tabs button{flex:1;min-height:44px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-forme-tabs button{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "FORME · 金属色样",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "forme-material-selected",
      "description": "现有带名称的四种金属色样；渐变只用于表达材质，默认金色。",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-forme-materials\"><button><span class=\"ds-forme-metal ds-forme-silver\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>银色</button><button class=\"ds-active\"><span class=\"ds-forme-metal ds-forme-gold\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>金色</button><button><span class=\"ds-forme-metal ds-forme-rose\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>玫瑰金</button><button><span class=\"ds-forme-metal ds-forme-graphite\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>石墨色</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-forme-materials{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:8px;margin-top:18px}.ds-forme-materials button{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;align-items:center;min-height:78px;padding:8px 0 10px;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:2px;background:none;color:#302c29;font:12px Manrope,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;white-space:nowrap;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color .16s,color .16s,border-color .16s}.ds-forme-materials .ds-active{border-color:#71394a;background:#ede6df}.ds-forme-materials button:hover{background:#ede6df}.ds-forme-materials button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #71394a;outline-offset:3px}.ds-forme-metal{display:block;position:relative;overflow:hidden;flex:none;width:33px;height:33px;border:1px solid #00000016;border-radius:50%;background:var(--sample)}.ds-forme-silver{--sample:#bfc4c4}.ds-forme-gold{--sample:#d4b477}.ds-forme-rose{--sample:#d6a38e}.ds-forme-graphite{--sample:#666b68}.ds-forme-metal:after{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(130deg,#ffffff80 5%,transparent 36%,#ffffff90 48%,transparent 64%,#00000015 90%)}@media(max-width:700px){.ds-forme-materials{gap:12px;margin-top:10px}.ds-forme-materials button{min-height:74px;padding:8px 0;gap:6px}.ds-forme-metal{width:32px;height:32px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-forme-materials button{transition:none}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "相言 · 为心意留形",
    "overview": "相言沿用用户指定的珠宝品牌官网原型，以暖纸色、中文标题和佩戴图呈现银色首饰，首页、定制编辑器与购物车共享顶部导航、主题选择和按钮语言。珠宝先行。巴黎极简为默认主题，法式浪漫、意式雕塑和建筑黑白只改变界面的颜色、圆角与标题气质。\n\n保留艺术字标。中文「相言」使用既有自绘 SVG，英文辅字使用已有 Cormorant Garamond；佩戴图明确标为 AI 示意，真实产品图与三维模型保持自身材质和颜色。\n\nFORME 保持原样。模组编辑器内部继续使用已确认的 A · 铂纸画廊，纸白画布、平直参数栏和暗红选中态不随这次官网重设计改写；本轮同步的是官网、Ring 02 与四款原始模型编辑流程，未改动模组的视觉实现。",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "四主题共用界面结构；顶部原生 select 切换并保留选择。",
      "中文宋体标题与系统无衬线控件形成层级；建筑黑白改用无衬线粗标题。",
      "产品图区保持纯白，银色模型不叠加界面主题滤镜。",
      "FORME 保留独立的 forme-* 词元、细线面板与带名称的金属色样。"
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "Product Color",
        "body": "主题控制页面表面、文字和控件，不给产品图片或三维画布添加主题滤镜；五款银色模型的金属外观不由 UI 主题决定。",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "Readable Selection",
        "body": "编辑器浅底选中项使用 accent-hover 文字、accent 边线和 tint 底色；深色步骤页签使用 ink 底和 page 浅字，选择不能只靠颜色表示。",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "FORME Legibility",
        "body": "FORME 正常可见文字不小于 12px；数字使用等宽数字，次要文字统一使用 forme-muted，不把官网的历史小字号沿用到模组端。",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "FORME Quiet Surface",
        "body": "FORME 常驻面板靠表面色与细边线分区；阴影仅用于浮动导出菜单和对话框，金属色样的渐变只表达材质，不作为页面装饰。",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do 使用同一套当前主题变量连接首页、定制编辑器、购物车和顶部导航。",
      "Do 将 AI 佩戴示意、真实模型图和已确认方案快照明确区分。",
      "Do 保留中文可见标签、键盘焦点、减少动态效果偏好与错误恢复动作。",
      "Do 保留 FORME 的独立词元、可撤销重置和局部滚动参数区。",
      "Do 保留来源与许可证入口，并以真实几何、光照与清晰度改善珠宝展示。"
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't 把 UI 的古金、玫瑰或陶土强调色施加到银色产品材质上。",
      "Don't 将首页眉题或意式硬偏移阴影扩写为新界面的通用组件规范。",
      "Don't 用过度泛光掩盖切工、镶座或法线问题。",
      "Don't 将视觉比例标为实际克拉、戒围或生产规格。",
      "Don't 把本地整合、浏览器响应式检查或几何预筛选写成已部署、手机真机验证或制造认证。"
    ]
  }
}
